Prices match Ledger: total acquisition costs retain more than ten decimal places.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager prices --sort date,account

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity ZEBRA
  format 1000 ZEBRA
commodity ALPHA
  format 1000 ALPHA
commodity Long_Fund_Name
  format 1000 Long_Fund_Name
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
account Assets:Funds
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Funds  4096 ALPHA {{1 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -1 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 ALPHA    0.000244140625 SEK
